    <front><titlePage><docTitle><titlePart>The Glass Orchard</titlePart></docTitle><docAuthor>DesignCraft test authors</docAuthor></titlePage><div><head>Preface</head><p>A book for testing <hi rendition="#emphasis">editable</hi> text.</p></div></front>
    <body>
      <div xml:id="chapter-one"><head>At the Gate</head><pb n="1"/>
        <p>The <choice><sic>gaet</sic><corr>gate</corr></choice> opened onto an <choice><orig>olde</orig><reg>old</reg></choice> orchard. <choice><abbr>Dr.</abbr><expan>Doctor</expan></choice> Vale waited there.</p>
        <p>A <app><lem wit="#A">silver</lem><rdg wit="#B">golden</rdg></app> bell rang.<note><p>The bell was <hi rend="italic">small</hi>.</p><p>Its handle was wood.</p></note> The keeper wrote <g ref="#longs"/> in his book.</p>
        <p>They crossed the thresh<lb break="no"/>old and saw <supplied>three</supplied> trees, <unclear>perhaps</unclear> four. <del>A discarded sentence.</del><add>A restored sentence.</add> Then <gap reason="torn leaf"/>.</p>
        <list type="ordered"><item n="1.">A key</item><item n="2.">A lantern</item></list>
        <figure><graphic url="orchard.svg" width="200pt"/><head>The orchard plan</head><figDesc>Three trees beside a gate.</figDesc></figure>
        <table><row role="label"><cell cols="2">Harvest</cell></row><row><cell rows="2">Apples</cell><cell>12</cell></row><row><cell>14</cell></row></table>
        <p>Continue to <ref target="#verse">the song</ref> or <ref target="https://tei-c.org/">the TEI site</ref>.</p>
      </div>
      <div xml:id="verse"><head>The Song</head><pb n="2"/><lg><l>Under glass the branches bend,</l><l>Words take root and lines extend.</l></lg><lg><l>Every leaf retains its name,</l><l>Though the pages change their frame.</l></lg></div>
      <div><head>A Short Scene</head><castList><castItem><role>KEEPER</role><roleDesc>guardian of the orchard</roleDesc></castItem></castList><sp><speaker>KEEPER</speaker><stage>Opens the gate.</stage><p>Bring the book inside.</p></sp><sp><speaker>VALE</speaker><p>Every word is here.</p></sp></div>
    </body>
